  data: {
    LLM: 'Each turn: draw one card from stock or top of discard pile; optionally drop up to four cards as new groups or runs or add to existing table melds (groups of 3–4 equal rank, runs of 3+ same suit, Aces low); discard one card face up. First player does not draw, only drops and discards. No player may drop more than four cards in one turn. Play ends when a player goes out by discarding their last card, or when stock is exhausted.',
    Player: 'Each turn: draw one card from stock or top of discard pile; optionally drop up to four cards as new groups or runs or add to existing table melds (groups of 3–4 equal rank, runs of 3+ same suit, Aces low); discard one card face up. First player does not draw, only drops and discards. No player may drop more than four cards in one turn. Play ends when a player goes out by discarding their last card, or when stock is exhausted.',
    objective: 'Go out (Shed all cards) or have lowest spot count.',
    gameplay: 'Each turn: draw one card from stock or top of discard pile; optionally drop up to four cards as new groups or runs or add to existing table melds (groups of 3–4 equal rank, runs of 3+ same suit, Aces low); discard one card face up. First player does not draw, only drops and discards. No player may drop more than four cards in one turn. Play ends when a player goes out by discarding their last card, or when stock is exhausted.',
    keyRules: [
      'Max four cards may be dropped in one turn; only one new group or run per turn.',
      'Aces are always low; Q-K-A is not a valid run.',
      'Going out requires a final discard; a player with two cards who draws a completing card must discard one and cannot go out that turn.',
